WEBVTT

00:29:05.538 --> 00:29:08.538
Hi and welcome back to my conversation
with Jane Goodall.

00:29:11.079 --> 00:29:14.121
There's a Max Planck saying
that it gets paraphrased

00:29:14.121 --> 00:29:16.788
as saying that science progresses
one funeral at a time.

00:29:17.996 --> 00:29:20.288
And I think you've known many
more scientists than

00:29:20.288 --> 00:29:23.329
I have who just were unwilling to
let go of their pet theories.

00:29:24.371 --> 00:29:26.329
And this is clearly not a problem for you.

00:29:26.663 --> 00:29:29.371
It almost seems like you're immune
to confirmation bias.

00:29:29.996 --> 00:29:33.496
And, you know, to go and discover
not only the chimps use tools,